00:00:56.220 --> 00:01:00.930
♪ The dawn piercing horn is being played by now ♪

00:01:00.930 --> 00:01:04.060
♪ Is that a fantasy or just past memories? ♪

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:08.600
♪ Eyes wide open, but I can't tell ♪

00:01:09.430 --> 00:01:12.560
♪ which side of the road am I running on ♪

00:01:12.810 --> 00:01:19.930
♪ Would I know the memories and breaks mixed in morning light? ♪

00:01:20.810 --> 00:01:23.310
♪ They said you shouldn't march on ♪

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:25.810
♪ They said you have to say goodbye ♪

00:01:25.930 --> 00:01:30.310
♪ They say you can have no tomorrow but dark night ♪

00:01:30.560 --> 00:01:32.930
♪ Over the finish line ♪

00:01:32.930 --> 00:01:35.430
♪ I will restart my dream again ♪

00:01:35.430 --> 00:01:37.220
♪ Even if it's dangerous ♪

00:01:37.390 --> 00:01:42.430
♪ I will keep marching and get my crown back ♪

00:01:42.430 --> 00:01:45.850
♪ Put on my armor and step to the unknown future ♪

00:01:46.220 --> 00:01:51.020
♪ Hold on to my light on the road together with you ♪

00:01:51.020 --> 00:01:52.100
♪ becomes the power that supports me ♪

00:01:52.270 --> 00:01:55.680
♪ The morning light that burns in my heart ♪

00:01:55.720 --> 00:01:58.060
♪ will blossom at dawn ♪

00:01:58.350 --> 00:02:00.770
♪ Dawn of Glory on battlefield ♪

00:02:00.770 --> 00:02:04.020
♪ I will show you my edge ♪

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:12.720
<b>Ancient Gods</b>

00:02:19.430 --> 00:02:20.220
He can fly?

00:02:20.220 --> 00:02:21.270
What kind of weapon is this?

00:02:28.970 --> 00:02:30.220
Got ya!

00:02:36.600 --> 00:02:37.810
Old Wei?

00:02:41.270 --> 00:02:43.060
Why do you have to be so difficult?

00:02:43.060 --> 00:02:44.060
Just die and let me get that 500 bucks.

00:02:44.060 --> 00:02:46.300
(Blue Brook, Windward Formation)

00:02:47.560 --> 00:02:50.600
You mean that reward to kill me?

00:02:50.890 --> 00:02:52.140
It's been cancelled.

00:02:52.140 --> 00:02:53.810
Haven't you seen the latest news?

00:02:53.810 --> 00:02:55.270
Is it?

00:02:55.270 --> 00:02:58.180
So we've been practicing all these days for nothing?

00:02:58.720 --> 00:02:59.680
It's not my fault.

00:02:59.680 --> 00:03:01.680
You should have done this earlier.

00:03:01.770 --> 00:03:02.770
It just got cancelled.

00:03:02.850 --> 00:03:04.560
You're not bluffing, are you?

00:03:04.890 --> 00:03:05.930
What news?

00:03:06.180 --> 00:03:07.180
Send me the link.

00:03:08.140 --> 00:03:08.850
Wait.

00:03:13.270 --> 00:03:14.310
It's Life-Risking Strike!

00:03:14.310 --> 00:03:15.100
Watch out!

00:03:18.930 --> 00:03:19.680
Body Replacement Technique?

00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:25.140
You win.

00:03:26.060 --> 00:03:27.770
We didn't get him?

00:03:27.770 --> 00:03:29.180
Like, seriously?

00:03:29.180 --> 00:03:30.140
Of course.

00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:31.220
I knew you would have done so.

00:03:31.720 --> 00:03:34.140
Who's that chick yelling just now?

00:03:34.640 --> 00:03:35.890
You're such a crook!

00:03:36.140 --> 00:03:37.270
You ambushed us as soon we logged in.

00:03:37.270 --> 00:03:38.350
And then you attacked us from behind?

00:03:38.350 --> 00:03:39.470
This is the new low.

00:03:41.020 --> 00:03:42.350
Write down my ID.

00:03:42.350 --> 00:03:44.270
You can ambush me as well.

00:03:45.350 --> 00:03:46.890
I'm so not that shameless.

00:03:47.220 --> 00:03:48.520
Go Solo with me if you got the balls.

00:03:50.390 --> 00:03:51.970
Are you a real chick?

00:03:52.060 --> 00:03:55.100
Cause' I mean if you're real hot,
you can be my company, I don't mind.

00:03:57.350 --> 00:03:59.810
I'm going to kill him right here and now!

00:04:01.720 --> 00:04:02.350
What?

00:04:04.140 --> 00:04:05.970
You won't say that if you know who he is.

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:08.270
Have you heard of Wei Chen before?

00:04:08.890 --> 00:04:09.720
Never heard of it.

00:04:09.970 --> 00:04:10.680
Who is that?

00:04:11.970 --> 00:04:13.560
He's the former captain of Blue Rain.

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:15.060
The first user of Swoksaar.

00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:16.520
But he retired early.

00:04:16.520 --> 00:04:17.600
Swoksaar?

00:04:18.140 --> 00:04:20.560
Isn't that the account of Yu Wenzhou, captain of Blue Rain?

00:04:20.560 --> 00:04:22.060
All-Star level master.

00:04:22.600 --> 00:04:23.220
But he...

00:04:23.220 --> 00:04:24.770
He looks like a thug!

00:04:25.600 --> 00:04:26.720
Well, he's from the street.

00:04:26.720 --> 00:04:27.810
He's a bit of a gangster.

00:04:28.220 --> 00:04:31.100
When we first started in Glory,
he's already at a certain age.

00:04:31.100 --> 00:04:32.600
So he retired after about two years.

00:04:32.850 --> 00:04:34.020
Was he good?

00:04:34.350 --> 00:04:36.390
You know Yu Wenzhou and Huang Shaotian, right?

00:04:36.810 --> 00:04:37.930
They were taught by him.

00:04:38.600 --> 00:04:41.100
Their styles are pretty much inherited from him.

00:04:42.640 --> 00:04:44.850
Slow-hand and chatterbox?

00:04:44.850 --> 00:04:46.430
Do you have to be that negative?

00:04:47.140 --> 00:04:48.430
Comrade Ye Qiu.

00:04:48.640 --> 00:04:50.060
Can you stop hiding?

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:52.100
Let's have a head-on fight, shall we?

00:04:52.770 --> 00:04:55.680
He is got that many people
and he tells you to go head-on?

00:04:56.180 --> 00:04:57.970
Nobody's gonna stop you from getting help.

00:04:59.100 --> 00:05:00.470
Except for you, lady.

00:05:00.890 --> 00:05:01.970
You don't even count.

00:05:01.970 --> 00:05:04.470
You're just a body count.

00:05:04.470 --> 00:05:06.060
I'm going to kill him!

00:05:06.060 --> 00:05:07.140
Calm down.

00:05:07.470 --> 00:05:08.640
You are no match for him.

00:05:08.970 --> 00:05:09.890
I'll handle him.

00:05:10.390 --> 00:05:13.890
If he is who you said to be,
then is Blue Brook behind this?

00:05:14.390 --> 00:05:15.020
I don't think so.

00:05:15.350 --> 00:05:17.810
Blue Brook got better players than these folks.

00:05:18.060 --> 00:05:20.020
I don't think they would give him a team like this.

00:05:20.770 --> 00:05:22.350
Then he didn't do it for Blue Brook.

00:05:22.720 --> 00:05:23.970
And the money is gone.

00:05:24.350 --> 00:05:25.470
Why is he still here?

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:27.270
For fun, maybe.

00:05:27.600 --> 00:05:29.100
He ain't got nothing to do anyway.

00:05:29.310 --> 00:05:31.060
Ye Qiu, wherever you are, listen.

00:05:31.520 --> 00:05:33.100
You've been surrounded.

00:05:33.640 --> 00:05:36.060
Come out and die is your only way out.

00:05:36.640 --> 00:05:38.810
Just let us finish you.

00:05:39.100 --> 00:05:42.640
I want that 500 bucks for chicken dinner.

00:05:43.180 --> 00:05:45.680
Didn't I tell you the money's gone?

00:05:45.680 --> 00:05:47.970
Do you really don't know or are you just pretending?

00:05:48.430 --> 00:05:49.430
I beg your pardon?

00:05:49.680 --> 00:05:50.890
Can't really hear you.

00:05:51.100 --> 00:05:52.430
Louder maybe?

00:05:53.560 --> 00:05:54.850
You're not gonna fight.

00:05:54.850 --> 00:05:55.890
You're not gonna leave.

00:05:56.180 --> 00:05:57.970
You just hide and wait.

00:05:58.220 --> 00:05:59.850
What, you're really getting help?

00:06:00.810 --> 00:06:02.970
Now I have to go get more men.

00:06:03.930 --> 00:06:06.640
That 500 bucks won't be enough even for coffee.

00:06:08.890 --> 00:06:09.970
Almost got me.

00:06:10.560 --> 00:06:11.180
Dang it.

00:06:11.850 --> 00:06:12.810
He got away again.

00:06:13.350 --> 00:06:15.220
He's definitely something.

00:06:15.890 --> 00:06:17.520
Don't ever leave the game today.

00:06:17.520 --> 00:06:18.810
Let's see how long you can hide.

00:06:19.100 --> 00:06:20.390
That's what I wanna say to you.

00:06:22.180 --> 00:06:24.890
Talking big while fleeing.

00:06:25.220 --> 00:06:26.310
You are definitely Ye Qiu.

00:06:26.310 --> 00:06:26.970
I knew it!

00:06:27.220 --> 00:06:28.680
My help is on the way.

00:06:28.680 --> 00:06:29.680
You watch it.

00:06:35.520 --> 00:06:36.560
Help?

00:06:37.060 --> 00:06:38.640
You didn't mean that silly chick, right?

00:06:44.720 --> 00:06:45.810
Now this is low!

00:06:45.810 --> 00:06:47.060
Get him down!

00:06:53.890 --> 00:06:55.520
Let's see how you gonna dodge this.

00:07:02.890 --> 00:07:03.560
Bye bye...

00:07:03.970 --> 00:07:06.520
What a mean weapon.

00:07:06.520 --> 00:07:08.020
Gamma, come back.

00:07:08.020 --> 00:07:09.640
Go to 3958, 2564.

00:07:09.640 --> 00:07:10.970
Alpha, go cut him off.

00:07:10.970 --> 00:07:11.770
On it, boss.

00:07:11.770 --> 00:07:13.560
Beta take left, go join Delta.

00:07:13.560 --> 00:07:14.890
I need four who can move fast.

00:07:14.890 --> 00:07:15.810
See if you can get around him.

00:07:39.220 --> 00:07:40.680
Nice moves.

00:07:42.350 --> 00:07:43.970
Tell me about it.

00:07:50.680 --> 00:07:52.140
Hexagram Prison?

00:07:52.560 --> 00:07:53.560
Somebody's behind you!

00:07:53.560 --> 00:07:55.390
You think you can fool me?

00:07:55.390 --> 00:07:56.470
Hell no.

00:07:56.970 --> 00:07:58.020
Well, hell yes.

00:07:58.350 --> 00:07:59.220
Say hi to the Phantom Demon.

00:08:05.560 --> 00:08:10.100
One Inch Ash from Server 10 completed
the Heavily Domain Challenge.

00:08:10.100 --> 00:08:12.270
He now enters the Heavenly Domain.

00:08:12.850 --> 00:08:15.930
This is the help you've been waiting for?

00:08:16.390 --> 00:08:17.930
A level 55?

00:08:19.020 --> 00:08:20.100
Wow, impressive.

00:08:20.100 --> 00:08:20.810
Slow down, man.

00:08:20.810 --> 00:08:21.810
Somebody help.

00:08:22.140 --> 00:08:23.220
Yifan, don't be careless.

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:25.390
This guy would do anything to win.

00:08:26.220 --> 00:08:28.270
He ain't got no limits.

00:08:28.520 --> 00:08:29.680
Just knock him down.

00:08:29.680 --> 00:08:30.390
ASAP.

00:08:32.020 --> 00:08:33.850
Ye Qiu, you bastard.

00:08:33.850 --> 00:08:37.560
You are the king of low and no-limits.

00:08:37.560 --> 00:08:39.020
Don't try to pin it on me.

00:08:39.810 --> 00:08:40.520
Young man.

00:08:40.520 --> 00:08:42.020
You got some nice moves.

00:08:42.470 --> 00:08:43.390
Which team you're in?

00:08:44.180 --> 00:08:44.890
Tiny Herb.

00:08:45.850 --> 00:08:47.520
Tiny Herb?

00:08:49.100 --> 00:08:50.430
That's a great team.

00:08:51.310 --> 00:08:53.430
You know what, I happen to know your captain.

00:08:53.850 --> 00:08:56.270
I can talk to him, maybe even put you on the starting lineup.

00:08:56.680 --> 00:08:59.640
I have a say over things like this.

00:09:00.020 --> 00:09:00.930
You're not bad.

00:09:00.930 --> 00:09:03.180
All you need is an opportunity.

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:06.640
Sorry, but I'm not ready for that opportunity.

00:09:06.640 --> 00:09:07.390
No.

00:09:07.390 --> 00:09:09.520
You are not ready in the past.

00:09:10.180 --> 00:09:12.720
But you're ready now!

00:09:13.350 --> 00:09:15.680
Your time has come!

00:09:15.680 --> 00:09:16.970
Now get ready and let's go!

00:09:16.970 --> 00:09:18.020
Zhou Yebo!

00:09:19.720 --> 00:09:21.140
I'm not Zhou Yebo.

00:09:22.970 --> 00:09:24.140
Impressive.

00:09:24.140 --> 00:09:27.220
Took two hits just to google him.

00:09:27.220 --> 00:09:28.810
Unfortunately you messed it up.

00:09:28.810 --> 00:09:30.560
Got it all wrong, man.

00:09:30.890 --> 00:09:31.770
Seriously?

00:09:31.770 --> 00:09:32.600
Who are you then?

00:09:33.890 --> 00:09:35.100
My name is Qiao Yifan.

00:09:35.850 --> 00:09:37.100
Qiao Yifan?

00:09:37.100 --> 00:09:39.220
Isn't Qiao Yifan an assassin?

00:09:39.220 --> 00:09:40.470
Come on.

00:09:40.930 --> 00:09:42.220
Yifan, don't listen to him.

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:44.470
He doesn't know your captain.

00:09:44.970 --> 00:09:47.680
He doesn't even know how to get
to the south entrance of Tiny Herb.

00:09:48.720 --> 00:09:51.100
Of course, I know how to get to the south entrance.

00:09:51.100 --> 00:09:53.430
I had dinner with your Captain Wang the other day.

00:09:54.810 --> 00:09:58.520
We don't have a south entrance.

00:09:59.560 --> 00:10:01.520
That's what I said! You're lower than me!

00:10:01.520 --> 00:10:03.060
I'm gonna kill you!

00:10:04.390 --> 00:10:05.020
Watch out!

00:10:11.770 --> 00:10:13.640
Too green.

00:10:17.100 --> 00:10:19.680
You waiting for the bus or what.

00:10:19.680 --> 00:10:20.930
Go get him, all of you!

00:10:20.930 --> 00:10:22.430
You do realize I'm here, right?

00:10:23.140 --> 00:10:24.600
I know you're here.

00:10:24.600 --> 00:10:25.770
Yifan, Ice Boundary.

00:10:26.600 --> 00:10:27.270
Interrupt him!

00:10:27.270 --> 00:10:28.720
Cast all the boundaries you can.

00:10:38.310 --> 00:10:39.640
Are you really enjoying this?

00:10:39.640 --> 00:10:42.600
You think you can kill all of us with two level 55?

00:10:42.600 --> 00:10:43.930
Here comes the full-level account!

00:10:46.430 --> 00:10:49.100
That low-rank, take this!

00:10:50.350 --> 00:10:51.850
How is that silly chick back?

00:11:00.310 --> 00:11:01.390
Where's that low-rank?

00:11:01.390 --> 00:11:02.220
He's been hiding somewhere?

00:11:02.220 --> 00:11:03.100
Is he dead?

00:11:03.310 --> 00:11:04.140
Not yet.

00:11:04.140 --> 00:11:05.350
He got away.

00:11:05.770 --> 00:11:07.430
He doesn't give a heck about his teammates.

00:11:07.430 --> 00:11:08.520
He has no team-spirit at all.

00:11:08.520 --> 00:11:09.890
Old Wei, come on out.

00:11:09.890 --> 00:11:12.020
Come out and die is your only choice.

00:11:12.020 --> 00:11:14.020
Or you can pay us 500 bucks.

00:11:14.430 --> 00:11:16.430
Maybe I'll let you live.

00:11:17.850 --> 00:11:19.350
Ye Qiu, go to hell!

00:11:19.350 --> 00:11:20.930
I am so not going to surrender.

00:11:20.930 --> 00:11:22.680
I will fight you to the end!

00:11:23.140 --> 00:11:24.310
Don't stop.

00:11:24.310 --> 00:11:25.970
He'll definitely log out once he's out of combat.

00:11:25.970 --> 00:11:28.930
Remember, he ain't got no limits.

00:11:29.220 --> 00:11:30.060
Okey dokey.

00:11:32.310 --> 00:11:33.970
Think about your team.

00:11:34.220 --> 00:11:35.720
They died for you.

00:11:35.720 --> 00:11:37.850
You gonna be the only one standing
with their blood at your feet?

00:11:37.850 --> 00:11:38.600
Shut up!

00:11:38.600 --> 00:11:39.890
You're the one who killed them!

00:11:39.890 --> 00:11:41.930
Don't count on them to come back and save you.

00:11:42.270 --> 00:11:45.180
They don't buy you anymore.

00:11:48.520 --> 00:11:50.890
I contacted Blue Brook, they are sending their men right now.

00:11:50.890 --> 00:11:52.520
Don't you leave!

00:11:52.930 --> 00:11:54.850
I won't leave until I finish you.

00:11:54.850 --> 00:11:56.720
Well, you have to come find me first.

00:11:56.720 --> 00:11:59.100
You think we attacked you for nothing?

00:11:59.100 --> 00:12:00.890
I bet you're still in combat.

00:12:00.890 --> 00:12:03.970
So, it's not that hard to guess where you are.

00:12:04.350 --> 00:12:06.350
You don't hear us walk, right?

00:12:06.930 --> 00:12:09.680
That's because, we're squat-walking now.

00:12:10.140 --> 00:12:11.350
At your back!

00:12:11.850 --> 00:12:12.850
The heck you did that for?

00:12:14.100 --> 00:12:14.850
Just to scare him.

00:12:15.470 --> 00:12:16.180
He's right there.

00:12:24.680 --> 00:12:25.810
Cancel attack.

00:12:26.100 --> 00:12:26.850
Use the machine gun on him.

00:12:27.140 --> 00:12:27.930
Ye Qiu.

00:12:27.930 --> 00:12:29.470
Go Solo with me if you're a man!

00:12:29.470 --> 00:12:30.720
Sure, just stop there.

00:12:30.720 --> 00:12:31.850
I'll go Solo with you.

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:34.270
Like I believe you!

00:12:39.350 --> 00:12:40.270
We're about to get him.

00:12:40.520 --> 00:12:41.470
Not so sure.

00:12:41.470 --> 00:12:42.430
That's a dungeon ahead.

00:12:43.060 --> 00:12:44.470
That's a dungeon for a hundred.

00:12:44.470 --> 00:12:46.810
Go in there alone is like committing suicide.

00:12:47.680 --> 00:12:49.970
You die in a dungeon, you don't lose your items.

00:12:50.810 --> 00:12:54.180
You probably didn't notice,
but he's got that silver weapon.

00:12:55.140 --> 00:12:55.890
Is it?

00:12:56.850 --> 00:12:57.810
How did he get one?

00:12:58.270 --> 00:12:59.180
From the Blue Rain?

00:12:59.470 --> 00:13:00.310
Probably not.

00:13:00.640 --> 00:13:01.850
Probably he made it himself.

00:13:01.850 --> 00:13:03.020
He's been a gamer for so many years.

00:13:03.020 --> 00:13:04.680
He can make himself a silver weapon.

00:13:04.680 --> 00:13:05.600
It's no surprise.

00:13:06.890 --> 00:13:08.680
Mister, I'm afraid we can't get to him.

00:13:09.770 --> 00:13:11.810
Want to kill me? Next decade maybe.

00:13:23.930 --> 00:13:25.310
Ye Qiu, you shameless freak!

00:13:25.310 --> 00:13:26.720
You can't just do that!

00:13:26.720 --> 00:13:28.720
Do you even know what it means to have a fair play?

00:13:29.060 --> 00:13:29.680
OK.

00:13:30.100 --> 00:13:31.100
Now he's all yours.

00:13:31.100 --> 00:13:31.970
Yifan.

00:13:31.970 --> 00:13:32.600
Slice him.

00:13:32.600 --> 00:13:32.930
Yes, sir.

00:13:33.430 --> 00:13:34.810
Young man, young man.

00:13:34.810 --> 00:13:35.970
I can tell you're a nice boy.

00:13:35.970 --> 00:13:38.770
If you got my item when I'm dead,
can you give it back to me?

00:13:39.220 --> 00:13:40.060
OK?

00:13:40.060 --> 00:13:40.560
Great!

00:13:40.560 --> 00:13:41.520
I'll get off my gears right now.

00:13:41.520 --> 00:13:42.520
You can kill me any second.

00:13:44.680 --> 00:13:46.560
He's nice, not stupid.

00:13:46.970 --> 00:13:47.680
Yifan, move.

00:13:47.680 --> 00:13:49.220
Let me finish him up.

00:13:51.140 --> 00:13:53.350
I will never let you do so.

00:13:53.350 --> 00:13:54.770
Young boy, step aside.

00:13:54.770 --> 00:13:56.270
Don't want you to be the collateral damage.

00:13:56.470 --> 00:13:58.390
Yifan, you didn't fall for that, did you?

00:13:58.810 --> 00:13:59.890
Stand behind him.

00:14:00.270 --> 00:14:01.430
Cut him off.

00:14:01.770 --> 00:14:03.310
Ye Qiu, you bastard!

00:14:04.310 --> 00:14:05.430
Low-rank.

00:14:05.430 --> 00:14:06.350
I'm here, too.

00:14:06.720 --> 00:14:07.390
OK.

00:14:07.390 --> 00:14:08.810
This time's on me.

00:14:08.810 --> 00:14:09.970
You obviously outnumber me.

00:14:09.970 --> 00:14:11.020
I'll take it.

00:14:11.430 --> 00:14:13.020
It doesn't matter if we outnumber you.

00:14:13.020 --> 00:14:14.310
Bluff to the last minute.

00:14:14.310 --> 00:14:15.180
We had a deal.

00:14:15.180 --> 00:14:16.890
This is my precious silver weapon.

00:14:16.890 --> 00:14:18.970
If you got it, you have to give it back to me.

00:14:19.470 --> 00:14:20.350
Sure.

00:14:20.850 --> 00:14:23.100
I'll give you everything back except for the silver weapon.

00:14:23.770 --> 00:14:26.020
I'm going to let you know the feeling of heartbreak.

00:14:26.430 --> 00:14:27.180
Silver weapon.

00:14:27.180 --> 00:14:27.890
Come on!

00:14:38.970 --> 00:14:39.720
Old Wei.

00:14:39.970 --> 00:14:41.140
You can cry me a river now.

00:14:42.310 --> 00:14:42.930
Ye Qiu!

00:14:42.930 --> 00:14:44.140
You get the freak out!

00:14:45.600 --> 00:14:47.310
Who the heck is been cursing master Ye Qiu?

00:14:49.600 --> 00:14:50.970
Your daddy.

00:14:50.970 --> 00:14:51.970
What?

00:14:55.470 --> 00:14:57.140
Oh, you want to call him names?

00:14:57.140 --> 00:14:58.350
Want me to join you?

00:15:00.850 --> 00:15:01.770
Go play your game.

00:15:01.770 --> 00:15:03.350
Bro Wei, what happened?

00:15:05.180 --> 00:15:06.060
They got my silver weapon.

00:15:17.640 --> 00:15:20.720
The King's Avatar 2

00:15:24.100 --> 00:15:25.430
Check on your item box.

00:15:25.720 --> 00:15:27.680
<b>Death Hand</b>

00:15:27.680 --> 00:15:27.850
Man, look at its points!
<b>Death Hand</b>

00:15:27.850 --> 00:15:29.560
Man, look at its points!

00:15:29.560 --> 00:15:31.560
That's amazing.

00:15:33.720 --> 00:15:36.060
First Season

00:15:38.810 --> 00:15:39.640
<b>Death Hand</b>

00:15:39.640 --> 00:15:41.430
It is not level 70 yet.

00:15:41.430 --> 00:15:42.970
And it has no skill points attached.

00:15:43.930 --> 00:15:45.310
<b>Wei Chen</b>

00:15:45.310 --> 00:15:46.890
Bastard, give me back my silver weapon!

00:15:46.890 --> 00:15:47.220
<b>Wei Chen</b>

00:15:48.350 --> 00:15:49.140
He is here.

00:15:51.020 --> 00:15:52.100
Why in such a rush?

00:15:52.140 --> 00:15:53.310
I wanna spend more time with it.

00:15:54.100 --> 00:15:54.680
What?

00:15:55.100 --> 00:15:56.970
You got plans on how to upgrade this weapon?

00:15:57.470 --> 00:16:00.100
If you ain't gonna clock out,
then you'd better hide it good.

00:16:00.100 --> 00:16:01.140
Don't die and lose it.

00:16:01.140 --> 00:16:02.270
Relax.

00:16:02.680 --> 00:16:04.600
By the way, got extra materials?

00:16:05.350 --> 00:16:05.810
Get out.

00:16:06.140 --> 00:16:07.520
I don't have enough for myself.

00:16:08.220 --> 00:16:09.600
Why do you need all those materials?

00:16:10.060 --> 00:16:11.390
It's just an online game.

00:16:11.720 --> 00:16:13.020
You don't need a silver weapon.

00:16:14.180 --> 00:16:15.430
I can sell it for you.

00:16:15.770 --> 00:16:16.970
We can split up the money.

00:16:16.970 --> 00:16:19.810
You go get a dope gear that'll blow up the game.

00:16:20.100 --> 00:16:21.680
I'll keep upgrading my silver weapon.

00:16:22.810 --> 00:16:24.470
Get out of here.

00:16:24.470 --> 00:16:27.180
Do you know how difficult it is to get to level 60?

00:16:27.180 --> 00:16:29.020
This is my precious!

00:16:29.100 --> 00:16:32.720
Attributes enhanced, Spell Critical Rate,
Casting speed, Casting Range.

00:16:33.600 --> 00:16:35.470
All points on the enhancement of personal attributes.

00:16:36.270 --> 00:16:40.180
This precious of yours is quite
different from the one of Swoksaar.

00:16:40.600 --> 00:16:42.640
What kind of weapon I use
is none of your freaking business.

00:16:43.390 --> 00:16:45.020
You must have been lonely, Old Wei.

00:16:48.060 --> 00:16:49.560
What the heck?

00:16:49.560 --> 00:16:50.810
I don't understand what you're saying.

00:16:53.020 --> 00:16:54.890
Why didn't you stay in the Blue Rain?

00:16:55.600 --> 00:16:57.720
I heard that they wanted you as a coach.

00:17:01.520 --> 00:17:03.060
I'm not interested in that.

00:17:03.930 --> 00:17:06.140
You want to stay on the field, don't you?

00:17:14.310 --> 00:17:17.470
You can never feel that in an online game, right?

00:17:22.680 --> 00:17:24.390
You don't need me to tell you about it.

00:17:24.810 --> 00:17:25.970
Have you ever thought about coming back?

00:17:27.140 --> 00:17:28.220
Come back?

00:17:28.680 --> 00:17:29.640
Me?

00:17:31.060 --> 00:17:32.520
It's not funny, master.

00:17:32.520 --> 00:17:33.520
So you just gonna give up like that?

00:17:34.140 --> 00:17:35.970
Or what?

00:17:35.970 --> 00:17:36.850
Let's do it one more time.

00:17:37.560 --> 00:17:38.770
One more time?

00:17:38.770 --> 00:17:43.640
Like just now, a full-level account with
a level 60 silver weapon, and 19 other players,

00:17:43.640 --> 00:17:45.810
but got beaten the hell out by you two level 55?

00:17:46.100 --> 00:17:47.140
One more time like this?

00:17:47.890 --> 00:17:48.930
For what?

00:17:49.430 --> 00:17:52.220
As long as you set your mind to it, nothing is impossible.

00:17:53.060 --> 00:17:55.180
You going stream-of-consciousness now?

00:17:56.060 --> 00:17:56.520
Yeah.

00:17:57.180 --> 00:17:58.770
Consciousness can also determine the outcome.

00:17:59.680 --> 00:18:01.140
Think about that guy on your team.

00:18:07.140 --> 00:18:08.890
He's a freak.

00:18:10.680 --> 00:18:13.680
I have to admit, I was wrong about him.

00:18:14.560 --> 00:18:16.680
I heard it was because you lost
to him you felt too embarrassed.

00:18:16.680 --> 00:18:19.100
That's why you decided to retire.

00:18:19.970 --> 00:18:23.600
My decisions would never be
interfered by such trivial things.

00:18:24.720 --> 00:18:25.520
No?

00:18:26.100 --> 00:18:29.220
Lost to a slow-hand who is
considered impossible to be a pro.

00:18:29.640 --> 00:18:32.060
It's a kick in the head, I can understand.

00:18:32.810 --> 00:18:34.560
The heck you understand!

00:18:45.310 --> 00:18:47.270
This kid just beat captain!

00:18:47.270 --> 00:18:49.100
Even Huang Shaotian couldn't do it.

00:18:49.600 --> 00:18:51.470
Maybe cap's just too tired.

00:18:52.880 --> 00:18:54.640
(Defeated)

00:18:54.640 --> 00:18:55.310
This...

00:18:55.310 --> 00:18:56.720
It's impossible.

00:18:56.720 --> 00:18:59.310
The slow-hand won two games in a row?

00:19:00.140 --> 00:19:01.930
Did you let him win?

00:19:01.930 --> 00:19:04.560
Don't pity him cause' he's the last in our camp.

00:19:04.560 --> 00:19:06.060
Bring out the real game.

00:19:07.310 --> 00:19:08.470
Well played.

00:19:08.890 --> 00:19:09.810
Let's go one more round.

00:19:10.520 --> 00:19:11.930
I'm not gonna go easy on you this time.

00:19:13.310 --> 00:19:14.060
OK.

00:19:16.850 --> 00:19:18.020
I can't underestimate him anymore.

00:19:18.430 --> 00:19:19.890
I have to watch out for his tactics.

00:19:20.430 --> 00:19:23.890
He might be slow in hands, but very good
at using all details of the fight.

00:19:24.520 --> 00:19:26.140
His mind and calculations.

00:19:26.470 --> 00:19:28.850
All those give him a perfect timing to attack.

00:19:30.720 --> 00:19:32.060
He casted an Exhaustion?

00:19:32.140 --> 00:19:33.850
He's still not giving up?

00:19:33.850 --> 00:19:35.140
Unfortunately that's it.

00:19:35.850 --> 00:19:36.430
That's okay.

00:19:36.930 --> 00:19:37.850
You've won two rounds.

00:19:37.850 --> 00:19:38.520
That's already impressive.

00:19:40.270 --> 00:19:41.430
Hexagram Prison?

00:19:41.430 --> 00:19:42.560
How could it get to me?

00:19:43.060 --> 00:19:45.930
He planned that Exhaustion!

00:19:47.620 --> 00:19:50.430
(Defeated)

00:19:59.930 --> 00:20:01.220
Thank you.

00:20:13.180 --> 00:20:14.140
And what about you?

00:20:14.430 --> 00:20:16.220
You just retired, now you wanna come back?

00:20:16.470 --> 00:20:17.930
You caused all these dramas.

00:20:17.930 --> 00:20:19.140
What's going on here?

00:20:20.310 --> 00:20:21.680
I thought about it.

00:20:22.060 --> 00:20:25.430
I want to make a big scene when I leave.

00:20:26.220 --> 00:20:30.970
I don't want to be a lonely man holding
a silver weapon in an online game.

00:20:30.970 --> 00:20:32.810
Get the freak out of my face!

00:20:34.680 --> 00:20:37.140
So, wanna ride with me?

00:20:37.680 --> 00:20:39.060
Take you back to the good old days?

00:20:39.890 --> 00:20:43.680
How good you think I am now
compared to me in the past?

00:20:45.270 --> 00:20:47.930
If we're talking about skills and speed,
you are not as half as good.

00:20:48.810 --> 00:20:52.060
But your lack of morality is still impressed me.

00:20:53.850 --> 00:20:55.890
Before, it was Yu Wenzhou who learned from you.

00:20:56.600 --> 00:20:58.720
Now would be the contrary.

00:20:59.680 --> 00:21:02.180
Now after all these years, the empire strikes back.

00:21:02.640 --> 00:21:03.640
He's gonna love this surprise.

00:21:04.560 --> 00:21:05.390
Isn't that fun?

00:21:06.560 --> 00:21:07.520
Sounds good.

00:21:08.220 --> 00:21:10.350
But according to the rules,
you have to take at least a year off.

00:21:10.600 --> 00:21:12.180
That means it'll be the next next season.

00:21:12.890 --> 00:21:15.720
I'll be 32 when I'm back in the Pro League.

00:21:15.720 --> 00:21:17.020
You want them to call me grandpa?

00:21:17.020 --> 00:21:18.020
You 32?

00:21:18.390 --> 00:21:19.350
I didn't expect you to be that young.

00:21:19.770 --> 00:21:20.680
I thought you're 40 something.

00:21:21.060 --> 00:21:21.770
The heck!

00:21:23.430 --> 00:21:25.390
We also need some time to break in.

00:21:26.140 --> 00:21:29.270
You don't want to come back
and then just lose, do you?

00:21:30.310 --> 00:21:31.930
Have you ever had the championship?

00:21:32.470 --> 00:21:33.060
Peace off!

00:21:33.720 --> 00:21:37.100
Don't you know who's that
low-rank got the triple crown?

00:21:39.020 --> 00:21:39.470
Wait.

00:21:41.270 --> 00:21:42.930
You want to come back and be the champion?

00:21:45.720 --> 00:21:49.140
Besides this, what could be more interesting?

00:21:52.430 --> 00:21:52.970
Sure.

00:21:53.310 --> 00:21:54.350
That's a great goal.

00:21:55.930 --> 00:21:56.640
I'm in.

00:21:56.970 --> 00:21:59.180
Now that you said yes, why don't you come to us?

00:21:59.720 --> 00:22:00.970
Let's make a good plan.

00:22:01.970 --> 00:22:04.720
Before you come, I'll have the Death Hand for now.

00:22:06.100 --> 00:22:10.430
If you lose it, you better kill yourself
before I come to finish you up.

00:22:12.320 --> 00:22:13.850
(Location: H City, Happy Net Cafe)

00:22:15.390 --> 00:22:18.890
Boys in the Pro League, on your knees.

00:22:23.640 --> 00:22:26.810
Daddy is now back!

00:22:48.720 --> 00:22:51.850
♪ If you can't see the sky with your head up ♪

00:22:53.270 --> 00:22:56.970
♪ Then look down and focus on where you're heading ♪

00:22:57.220 --> 00:23:01.810
♪ We all know that we don't want to bury our dreams ♪

00:23:01.810 --> 00:23:03.970
♪ Step back for the next take-off ♪

00:23:06.390 --> 00:23:08.600
♪ All channels are reconnected ♪

00:23:08.930 --> 00:23:10.560
♪ I remember you said you would wait ♪

00:23:10.810 --> 00:23:12.680
♪ Fine melody under my fingertips ♪

00:23:12.680 --> 00:23:14.850
♪ Perfect performance in digital world ♪

00:23:17.560 --> 00:23:19.560
♪ Brand-new melody, brand-new you and me ♪

00:23:19.600 --> 00:23:22.850
♪ Our passion will support us to the end ♪

00:23:22.850 --> 00:23:26.100
♪ Light the fire in you ♪

00:23:26.100 --> 00:23:28.220
♪ Shine away the weakness in dark ♪

00:23:28.220 --> 00:23:29.930
♪ You can laugh at me, you can look down on me ♪

00:23:29.930 --> 00:23:31.720
♪ They would only drive me further ♪

00:23:31.850 --> 00:23:34.970
♪ Take record of our pulses ♪

00:23:37.100 --> 00:23:38.970
♪ All those provocations ♪

00:23:38.970 --> 00:23:41.140
♪ They will only firm my steps ♪
